WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.260
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.260
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.680
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.680
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:13.480
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:13.480
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.660
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.660
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.580
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.580
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.120
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.120
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.420
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.420
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.800
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.800
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:44.300
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:44.300
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:48.640
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:48.640
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:53.980
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:53.980
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:58.980
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:58.980
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.150
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.150
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:07.200
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:07.200
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:12.290
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:12.290
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:17.250
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:17.250
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.000
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.000
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:23.340
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:23.340
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:40.060
THE DRAGON MASTERS APPROACH

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.280
Thank you for coming.

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:44.860
I've been waiting.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:50.250
It's been years
since we three have gathered.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:55.840
To require all of us must mean
something big is going on.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.250
Has the time come to burn the world?

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.460
My son, Dino, is alive.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:06.970
Master Dino?!

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:12.390
The Hero Dai, who fights
the Dark Army is my son, Dino.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:14.770
What a cruel twist of fate.

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:18.350
I've already fought the party he leads.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:25.280
<i>Their bond of unity was stronger than I
anticipated, and I sustained some wounds.</i>

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:28.160
You were wounded?!

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:32.080
So that's why you came to Argo Point.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:37.580
This is where the Fountain of Miracles
that heals Dragon Knights is located.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.250
That wasn't my only reason.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.670
<i>He means his wife.</i>

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:50.050
We understand, Master Baran.
You need our help to reclaim Master Dino.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:54.520
Exactly. My son has
some troublesome allies.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.150
They would risk death for Dai, the Hero.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:02.440
Especially the two Legion Commanders
who betrayed the Dark Army.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:07.240
Beast King Crocodine and Dark Swordsman
Hyunckel are not to be underestimated.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.620
You're joking!

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:14.330
No Legion Commander of the Dark Army
aside from you could stand up to us!

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:22.000
You may be the most powerful Dragon Riders
of all Darklings and Beastlings,

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:27.340
but humans can display terrifying strength
when they're prepared to die.

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:33.800
If his allies should resist,
you three must crush them.

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.690
In the meantime, I shall reclaim my son.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:38.560
Yes, Master!

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:42.650
I must prepare for battle.
Wait for me here.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:47.750
Master Baran is ever the cautious one.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.660
They're just a few humans
and a couple of traitors.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.700
Watch your tongue, Galdandy!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:58.290
Indeed. They say a lion
does not hold back when killing a hare.

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:05.210
Don't forget his caution has made
our glorious Dragon Legion undefeated.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.130
<i>I get it already.</i>

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:18.810
<i>Soala, this time I shall get Dino back...</i>

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:22.060
<i>from those filthy humans!</i>

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:33.450
The Dragon Legion shall now
head to Teran Kingdom!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:38.040
When my son, Dino, joins us,
our strength shall be absolute!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:38.740
Yes, Master!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.950
Follow me!

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.470
What a surprise.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:55.680
With everyone calling you "Princess,"
I wondered who you were.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.600
So you're the ruler of Papnica.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:05.900
Otherwise, small as Teran may be,
its king would not so easily hear us.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.910
His Majesty will see you know.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:16.450
He is not feeling well and asks that
you forgive an audience in his chambers.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:17.700
That's fine.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.370
I'll wait outside.
Call me when you're done.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.540
I see.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.840
So that supernatural storm
was caused by the Dragon Knight.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:35.630
And this child is the Dragon Knight's son.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:40.020
It may have been a Psychic Signal
that took his memories.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.560
A Psychic Signal?

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:46.940
Think of it as a mental wave
emitted from the Dragon Crest.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:49.570
How can we restore his memory?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.400
I do not know.

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:54.640
We merely worship the God of Dragons.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:06:00.160
We know of the Dragon Knight,
but not of the full breadth of its powers.

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:01.910
I see.

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:05.710
Then will you let us use this castle
to shelter Dai?

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:08.420
You still seek to fight?

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:09.590
We do.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:15.090
The people of Teran may think of
Baran's attack as divine will,

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.600
but it's an aggression against humanity.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.140
We will fight against aggression.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:25.180
I see. I had heard of the bravery
of the Princess of Papnica.

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:29.730
Kanar.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:30.990
Your Majesty!

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:35.030
You will aid Princess Leona.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.280
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.950
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.500
Tell me, are you the famed Seer...?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.130
Yes. I am Nabara.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.670
And this one?

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:51.170
This is my granddaughter, Merle.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.920
Come closer.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.300
Huh?

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.630
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:08.650
You possess power
beyond that of your grandmother's.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:13.900
Indeed. Recently, she's been able to
sense things I cannot.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:21.950
Your power shall soon show you
terrifying and horrible things to come.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:22.660
What?!

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:26.000
Do not resent your power.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.880
It shall eventually help save humanity.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:33.130
Trust that that day shall come
and live strong.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:34.840
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:39.890
What's wrong?!

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:44.680
It's coming! An energy of such wrath!
Straight for this country!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.230
You mean Baran?!

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.850
He's coming already?!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:49.520
That's not all!

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:53.480
Other similar energies... Three of them!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:56.610
What are you doing?!

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:59.070
Let me out! Let me out of here!

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:01.160
Isn't a prison cell going too far?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.750
But this is the deepest,
most impregnable place in the castle.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.410
But...

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:09.200
Let me out! Let me out!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.380
Young lady, do you know
what "imprinting" is?

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.420
Huh?

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:19.510
It's when an animal hatches from its egg,

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:22.720
and assumes
the first thing it sees is its parent.

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:28.060
Baran's reduced Dai to a state
of a newly hatched infant.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:35.560
If Dai encounters Baran now,
he'll probably accept Baran as his father.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:39.780
They bear the same mark
as irrefutable proof.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:43.990
It's cruel, but this is
the only way to prevent that.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:49.210
We'll take care of the rest.
Please guard the king.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:52.290
I'm sorry I could not do more.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:58.130
Dai...

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:07.810
They're headed straight for Teran
from the southeast.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.940
Can you show them, Old Lady?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:10.970
I think so.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.620
Who are they?!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:30.080
These are the three sources of energy
aside from Baran?

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.790
Could they be the Dragon Masters?!

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:33.790
The Dragon Masters?

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:37.550
The most powerful Dragon Riders
that serve Baran.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:43.340
With Dragons under their control, they're said
to rival even the Legion Commanders.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.760
You mean he's brought three guys
each as strong as you?!

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:51.270
<i>We may not be strong enough
to hold them back.</i>

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.810
<i>Fighting Baran alone was difficult enough.</i>

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:57.810
<i>If only Hyunckel was here.</i>

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:08.200
We're done for. I guess that blows it.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.580
Popp?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.710
Sorry, but I'm not about to
die for nothing.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:17.380
I'm bailing now.
You guys do whatever you like.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:20.130
What are you saying all of a sudden?!

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:22.470
I'm saying I'm getting out of here.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:27.890
If they're that strong, there's no point
in resisting. What a crock!

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.180
Popp, do you understand
what you're saying?!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:33.890
You're the ones who don't understand!

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:37.900
Dai's like this and we're falling apart.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.440
Now we're facing the most powerful Legion.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:44.200
You'd have to be crazy
to consider fighting now.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:48.530
I thought fighting for your friends,
even when there's no hope,

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:51.700
was what you
Disciples of Avan believed in!

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:56.380
If Dai falls into their hands now,
the human world will end!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:59.590
That's right!
I thought you were Dai's best friend!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.750
Are you really willing
to abandon Dai now and run?!

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:07.680
Don't worry about him.
He's not even human.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:12.350
He's one of them.
Why not give him back to them?

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.260
They'll take good care of him!

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:23.440
Very well. Get out of my sight.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:25.900
We won't enlist the aid of one like you.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:31.080
Well that's a relief. Thanks!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.410
Popp!

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:33.910
Wait, Popp!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.290
Do not follow him, Crocodine!

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.750
We need you here to defend this position.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.080
But...!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.130
Princess...

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:51.430
I've always admired the Disciples of Avan.

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:56.140
If Master Avan was still alive,
I was hoping to learn from him.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:02.440
I believed Popp would stay with us
because he's a Disciple of Avan.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:11.950
What happened to your courage, Popp?

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:13.700
Popp...?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:19.120
Popp...? Who...?

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:24.960
Popp!

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.500
Merle?

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:29.840
Was it all a lie?

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:34.020
When you said Dai was your friend
even if he was a monster!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:38.010
Were those words...
Those tears... All of it?

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.230
I hate you.

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.740
I don't like you anymore!

00:12:56.780 --> 00:13:02.210
I remember when Maam punched me
and said I disgusted her.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:06.550
<i>But this isn't like back then!</i>

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:11.180
<i>If I tried to go alone, you'd stop me.
That's why I had to say that.</i>

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.090
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:16.680
<i>Look after Dai, everyone!
I'll stop them, even if I die trying!</i>

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:21.560
<i>I may not win, but I'll take
one or two of them out with me!</i>

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:26.690
<i>So take care of the rest!</i>

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:33.030
CRACKLE ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:38.070
GIGABREAK

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.290
Stop right there!

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.800
You're not going any farther!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.680
Look who's here to stop us!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.350
Are the others lying in wait?

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.310
No, it doesn't seem like it.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:02.720
Are you insane?! Or just an idiot?!

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:07.480
<i>Victory to the quick!</i>

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:09.820
Galdandy, don't underestimate him!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.980
He wields spells
stronger than you'd expect.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.150
That scrawny wimp?!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.320
Donk!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.540
Be crushed!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.630
Please be crushed!

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:41.100
Thanks for lifting me up!
You're a real help, Ruud!

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:44.220
Dammit! One escaped above!

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:56.240
Such weak Dragons! Pathetic!

00:14:57.360 --> 00:15:01.200
You're brave to try to stop us alone.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:04.290
Master Baran, leave this to us.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:09.000
We shall catch up,
so you should hurry to Master Dino.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.790
Very well. I leave this to you.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.930
But don't underestimate him.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:19.140
I said it before,
humans who are prepared to die

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:22.640
can display terrifying strength.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:27.730
"A cornered rat will bite a cat."
You never know what the desperate will do.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.190
Isn't that what the humans say?

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.230
I'm going ahead.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.480
Hold it!

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.790
Dammit!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.030
Know your place, boy!

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:47.710
A pipsqueak like you couldn't fight
Master Baran in a million years!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.330
Shut up! Kafrizz!

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:57.920
With a single breath...?!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:03.220
That's not all you've got, is it?!

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:09.140
You thought you could fight
the Dragon Masters with that?!

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:16.020
Are you trying to make me laugh?!

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:23.580
Too frail, boy!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.460
That's enough, Borahorn.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.700
What?

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:29.460
He's nothing more than a fledgling.

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:34.330
Don't make him suffer.
Just drop him on this and end it.

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:40.760
I guess so.
For a toy, he's not very fun to play with.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:56.980
Galdandy?!

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:02.150
I'll take this toy
if you two don't want it!

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:08.920
He's a juicy human prey! It's no fun
unless we take our time killing him!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.370
As cruel as ever, I see.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:15.080
<i>They're strong! They're going to kill me!</i>

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:21.470
<i>Dammit! If I'm going to die,
I have to hit them at least once or twice!</i>

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.300
<i>Otherwise, what's the point in me dying?!</i>

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:31.730
Whoops. Are you dead already, kid?

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:34.770
I-It hurts! I'm done for!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:39.650
Please! Just end it by biting off my head!

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.490
Weakling!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:45.030
Oh well. Since you asked so nicely!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.330
Sizzle!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.500
I guess you can do anything
if you're desperate.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:03.300
I don't believe it. That kid killed
Galdandy's favorite Ethereal Serpent.

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:06.510
The rat actually bit the cat.

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:09.680
But his resistance comes at a steep price.

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:14.600
<i>That takes care of their Dragons.
The real fight starts now.</i>

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:24.190
This... This is impossible!

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:27.280
How could you die?!

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:30.450
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:36.290
How cruel! This is too much!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.880
What are you crying about, birdface?!

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:46.590
You've killed tons of humans!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:50.140
Killed tons of humans?

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:57.570
This Ethereal Serpent, Ruud,
was the only friend I ever trusted!

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:00.150
He was like my brother!

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:03.610
We were always together, no matter what.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:07.870
How dare you compare my beloved Dragon...

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:11.570
to some filthy little humans!

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.370
What are these feathers?!

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:17.750
They won't come out!

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.750
I'll slice you to pieces!

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:23.380
So much that
they'll never find your pieces!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.550
G-Get away from me!

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:31.850
<i>That's it! They're all on the ground now!</i>

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.100
Donk!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:37.900
My spell's not working?!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:41.030
You can't use
such powerful spells anymore.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:45.190
Your Magic Power is leaking out right now.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.360
You mean...?!

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:51.450
That's right. Those white feathers
drain an enemy's Magic Power!

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:53.500
Dammit!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:57.290
And these red feathers, drain stamina.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.500
Do you get it?

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:04.260
I'm going to reduce you to
an empty rag doll before I slice you up!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:07.130
I'll make you fear for your life!

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:09.470
Kafrizz!

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:12.800
Then, Frizzle!

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:15.180
Stop resisting!

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.900
<i>It's no good! I feel weak!</i>

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.110
I won't let you die so easily.

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:30.320
I'm dragging this out!

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:34.910
Take this and this and this!

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.080
Does it hurt?! I bet it does!

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:41.790
He's gone mad. Even we can't stop him now.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:45.840
The boy could've died painlessly
if he hadn't resisted.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.250
Poor kid.

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:55.140
You're braver than I thought.
That pisses me off!

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:59.480
<i>I've got to fight back! While I still have
stamina and Magic Power!</i>

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.060
<i>I have to do something!</i>

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.690
Oh! I like that face right there!

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:08.910
I know. I'll do what you did to Ruud!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.490
I'll blow your head off like him!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.240
That's it! That's the look!

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.580
Just keep that face!

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:29.630
Who's there?!

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:43.100
Great. I'm saved by
the last guy I want saving me.

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:46.350
Sorry to disappoint.

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:56.860
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:56.860
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:21:57.030 --> 00:22:00.830
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:21:57.030 --> 00:22:00.830
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:04.910
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:04.910
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:08.960
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:08.960
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:12.260
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:12.260
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:16.180
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:16.180
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:19.890
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:19.890
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:24.180
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:24.180
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:28.230
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:28.230
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:32.020
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:32.020
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:33.610 --> 00:22:37.610
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:33.610 --> 00:22:37.610
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:43.200
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:43.200
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:43.370 --> 00:22:47.000
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:43.370 --> 00:22:47.000
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:49.290
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:49.290
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:49.460 --> 00:22:53.460
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:49.460 --> 00:22:53.460
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:57.970
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:57.970
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:22:58.130 --> 00:23:01.140
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:22:58.130 --> 00:23:01.140
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:05.810
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:05.810
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:12.020
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:12.020
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:26.160
<i>Hyunckel arrived
just in time to save Popp.</i>

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:30.000
<i>With the best possible ally at his side,
against Galdandy and Borahorn,</i>

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:32.170
<i>they manage to get an advantage.</i>

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:38.550
<i>Larhart watches calmly,
until he finally lifts his ominous spear.</i>

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:42.510
<i>The ferocious battle between Hyunckel and
Larhart, the last Dragon Master, begins!</i>

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:45.260
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:47.180
<i>"Land Rider Larhart"</i>

00:23:47.350 --> 00:23:49.060
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
